# One of the Elite Four turns to face the player: a grand, grave call of brass and strings over timpani.
# Platinum's role SEQ_EYE_TENNO (the Elite Four). Original composition for this game.
title Eyes Meet! Elite Four
tempo 120
meter 4/4
reverb 0.35

